OL,3,GNEWSAM1 northbound reopens after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M1 has fully reopened following a
OL,7,Fcrash involving multiple vehicles.
OL,9,FIn a post on social media at 12:40 BST
OL,10,Fon Friday, National Highways said the
OL,11,Fnorthbound carriageway was closed
OL,12,Fbetween junction 23 for Shepshed and
OL,13,Fjunction 23A.
OL,15,FThe road reopened just before 13:00,
OL,16,Fthe traffic monitoring authority said
OL,17,Fin an update.
OL,19,FThere were delays of 45 minutes and
OL,20,Ffive miles of congestion on the
OL,21,Fapproach.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
